  "answer": "HippoRAG 方面，现有证据只说明它“builds a KG from scratch using LLMs”并进行“multi-hop retrieval”，即把语料组织成用大语言模型从零构建的知识图谱，通过多跳检索找回支持；它图构建与检索流程的具体跨段落机制描述证据不足 [chunk_513a6dee6b9d2e8bac593f0a139f9ba4]。KGP 方面，原文明确其图构建“create a knowledge graph (KG) over multiple documents with nodes symbolizing passages or document structures (e.g., pages/tables), and edges denoting the semantic/lexical similarity between passages or document structural relations”，即把多文档组织成节点为段落或文档结构、边为语义/词汇相似或结构关系的知识图谱；跨段落支持通过“an LLM-based graph traversal agent that navigates across nodes and gathers supporting passages”找回 [chunk_b959214e888053dae53b16a5259d7ea9]。",
